--TEST--
`toString` returns a `tainted string`, because a value inside the filter may be, so it does not compile where a `string` is needed — ADR 0278 § 6 and `rule:security/tainted-qualifier`
--FILE--
<?nvs
var $filter = Core\Ldap\Filter::not(Core\Ldap\Filter::present("mail"));
string $text = $filter->toString();
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0401]: expected `string`, found `tainted string`
  --> case.nvs:3:16
